---- TASK (issue #826) ----
Charter: #685
Depends-on: #823

## Context (self-contained)

Charter #685 fixes a queue-blocking bug: charter finale was gating auto-merge
on GHA-CI green, which is permanently red, so charters stayed stuck in finale
for hours blocking the entire queue. The fix replaces the GHA-CI gate with a
verify-merged call and uses gh pr merge --admin on PASS.

This leaf performs the cross-leaf integration review to verify correctness
before the charter is considered complete. All sibling leaves must be merged:
- #815 (qa-engineer): updated gh stub + new RED-f/RED-g test scenarios
- #821 (infra-engineer): verify-merged gate implementation in _finale_check_ci
- #823 (security-reviewer): admin-merge bypass scope sign-off

## Task

Review the merged state of reference/runtime/crewboss-launcher-gh.sh and
reference/tests/charter-finale.test.sh (after all sibling leaves are merged)
and verify all of the following invariants:

### 1. verify-merged call parameters match integrator pattern (lines 372-410)
Confirm the verify-merged call in _finale_check_ci uses:
  - branch: charter/CHARTER_ID (not a literal string, derived from cid)
  - base: main
  - --remote GIT_REMOTE (same remote variable used by integrator)
  - --repo CB_REPO
Compare directly against the integrator call at lines 372-373.

### 2. ci_state=red is NEVER written (fix-1)
Grep the entire updated function for any line that writes "red" to the
ci_state file. There must be zero such writes. Confirm the early-exit case
for ci_state=red (was lines 481-482) has been removed.

### 3. last_comment dedup prevents comment spam on repeated exit 1 (fix-3)
Verify that the verify-red comment is posted only when last_comment != "verify-red"
and that "verify-red" is written to _fin_dir/last_comment immediately after.
Subsequent ticks with vm_exit=1 must not re-post the comment.

### 4. Test stub distinguishes --admin vs non-admin merges (fix-2)
In charter-finale.test.sh, verify the pr merge handler in the gh stub logs
"pr-merge-admin N" when --admin is present and "pr-merge N" otherwise.
Verify charter_pr_merged_admin() helper greps for "pr-merge-admin".

### 5. Both test paths are covered by assertions
- RED-f (verify-green + CB_AUTO_MERGE=1): asserts charter_pr_merged_admin
  AND charter issue is CLOSED.
- RED-g (verify-red): asserts NO admin-merge, charter issue remains OPEN,
  RED_REASON comment is present, loop terminates normally.

### 6. Acceptance-convergence gate (lines 515-535) is unaffected
Confirm the acceptance_review_role check and status:acceptance-review routing
block is still in place and positioned BEFORE the verify-merged call.

### 7. Queue-continues invariant
Verify line ~845: _finale_check_ci CHARTER_ID PR_NUM || true
The || true must be present (non-zero return from _finale_check_ci never
blocks the queue). Confirm no other call sites to _finale_check_ci lack || true.

### 8. Run the full test suite
Run reference/tests/charter-finale.test.sh and confirm passed=N failed=0.

